{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18146","headline":"春雪间早梅 · 韩愈","name":"春雪间早梅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梅将雪共春，彩艳不相因。\n逐吹能争密，排枝巧妬新。\n谁令香满座，独使净无尘。\n芳意饶呈瑞，寒光助照人。\n𤫩珑开已徧，点缀坐来频\n那是俱疑似，须知两逼真。\n荧煌初乱眼，浩荡忽迷神。\n未许琼华比，从将玉树亲。\n先期迎献岁，更伴占兹晨。\n愿得长辉暎，轻微敢自珍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}